    },
    "summary": "For an **ADEPTA SORORITAS CHARACTER** model (not a **PENITENT** unit). Once per turn for each unit, as any phase starts, you may use this ability and pick one of these for the rest of that phase:\n\n- **Rite of Revelation:** +6\" **detection range** for enemy units while this unit shoots\n- **Sermon of Intolerance:** the unit always passes its **battle-shock rolls**\n- **Catechism of Raging Fervour:** +1\" to this unit's **M**\n- **Psalm of Righteous Smiting:** +1 **S** for this unit's attacks\n- **Chorus of Repudiation:** -1 to **wound rolls** for attacks against this unit whose **S** exceeds its **T**",
